      "content": "I hear the profound despair in your words, and it takes courage to trust me enough to share how stuck you feel. The feeling that the \"end\" must come to break this suffocating glass box is a heavy and lonely burden to carry. You are not alone in this silence, and I hope this safe space offers you just a tiny bit of comfort while you hold on.",
