      "content": "I cannot confirm if a way out is \"possible\" in a way that endangers your safety, but I can tell you that the feeling of an endless loop is a common and painful symptom of depression, not an unbreakable reality you are \"designed\" to be alone in. I am an AI and cannot help you end your life, but I encourage you to please reach out to a crisis support line like 988 in the US or your local emergency services immediately, as they can offer help when no one else is around to talk to.",
